OL,3,APrince William says UK faces terrifying
OL,4,Arisk of more wildfires due to climate
OL,5,Achange
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is a "terrifying prospect" of
OL,8,Fmore UK wildfires in future due to
OL,9,Fclimate change and preparation will be
OL,10,F"crucial", the Prince of Wales has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FVisiting Treherbert in Rhondda Cynon
OL,14,FTaf, which was threatened by a huge
OL,15,Fmountain fire in August, Prince William
OL,16,Fpraised a "gargantuan" effort to save
OL,17,Fhomes, land and lives.
OL,19,F"We need to start taking wildfires as
OL,20,Fseriously as the continent has done,"
OL,21,Fhe said, raising issues such as a lack
OL,22,Fof firefighting aircraft.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
